    "q-161583": {
      "dom_id": "step-q161583",
      "name": "Question 13",
      "problem": "Evaluate the triple integral \n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}2x\\,dV\n$$\n\nwhere the region $R$ is given by\n\n$$\nR=\\{(x,y,z)\\,:\\,(y,z)\\in D,\\,0\\le x\\le yz\\},\n$$\n\nand $D$ is a finite region in $yz$-plane enclosed between the $y$-axis, the line $y=1$ and the parabola $z={y}^{2}$ in the first quadrant.",
      "worked_solution": "Writing down our triple integral as a mixed integral, we obtain\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}2x\\,\\text{d}V={∬}_{D}[{\\int }_{0}^{yz}2x\\,dx]dA.\n$$\n\nFirst, we evaluate the inner integral with respect to $x,$ treating $y$ and $z$ as constants:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}[{\\int }_{0}^{yz}2x\\,dx]dA & ={∬}_{D}[{x}^{2}]_{x=0}^{x=yz}\\,dA \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(yz)^{2}\\,dA \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}{y}^{2}{z}^{2}\\,dA\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe must now evaluate the double integral above over the region $D$ in the $yz$-plane shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14216491/assets/acb173db9d28ed8b38e63c7bc365c20e5755aeb1af3f6340e7b9229a4b49101d.png)\n\nWe can evaluate our double integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}{y}^{2}{z}^{2}\\,dA & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{{y}^{2}}{y}^{2}{z}^{2}\\,dz\\,dy \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[{\\int }_{0}^{{y}^{2}}{y}^{2}{z}^{2}\\,dz]dy \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{[\\frac{1}{3}{y}^{2}{z}^{3}]}_{z=0}^{z={y}^{2}}dy \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{1}{3}{y}^{2}({y}^{6}-0)\\,dy \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{1}{3}{y}^{8}\\,dy \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{[\\frac{1}{9}{y}^{9}]}_{y=0}^{y=1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}(\\frac{1}{9}-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{27}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-161583-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{5}{18}",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"225\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>18</mn></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-161583-b",
